# Keep the build context small and predictable.
.git
.claude/
README.md
DOCKER.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
**/.DS_Store
*.stackdump
*.bak.rds
shiny_app/rsconnect/
# NOTE: shiny_app/app_data.rds is intentionally NOT ignored here — if you place the
# real bundle in shiny_app/ it becomes available for the optional self-contained COPY
# (see Dockerfile). At runtime it is normally supplied via a volume mount instead.
